,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!gbQdLckF2ZHmyKec.M9eaZFh0jVe7L3AZ"},{"_id":"qYnYOCGzCEzpeQ6o","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Camouflage Specialist","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>For encounters involving avoiding detection or hiding an object or creature, the camoufleur is a 5th-level challenge.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!gbQdLckF2ZHmyKec.qYnYOCGzCEzpeQ6o"},{"_id":"ouPZx6pI3tVOTE4n","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Forest Passage","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>The camoufleur ignores difficult terrain caused by plants, such as bushes, vines, and undergrowth.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!gbQdLckF2ZHmyKec.ouPZx6pI3tVOTE4n"},{"_id":"BIen3779hpIY37tp","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Natural Disguise","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>The camoufleur can use their @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Jvp0x2Sc82WVpExT]{Disguise Kit} to disguise a creature or object as natural flora. A creature gains a +2 item bonus to Stealth checks while in a natural environment until its next daily preparations or until its disguise is ruined, whichever comes first. An object in a natural environment can be found only by actively searching (using the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.TiNDYUGlMmxzxBYU]{Search} activity while exploring or the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action in an encounter) and uses the camoufleur's Stealth DC.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.ppYqbg4erAFt8C9W]{Effect: Natural Disguise}</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!gbQdLckF2ZHmyKec.BIen3779hpIY37tp"}],"name":"Tripkee Camoufleur","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":0},"con":{"mod":1},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":1},"str":{"mod":1},"wis":{"mod":3}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":18},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":30,"temp":0,"value":30},"speed":{"details":"forest passage","otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":20}],"value":25}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["common","tripkee"]},"level":{"value":2},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Camoufleurs, masters of natural camouflage, not only disguise their village scouts and warriors before they embark, but also create and maintain the village-wide concealment needed to keep their community hidden and safe. Just as others rely on engineers to build walls, tripkees rely on camoufleurs to protect their homes.</p><hr /><p>Traditionally making their homes in the treetops of tropical jungles and forests, these frog-like humanoids are often seen as resourceful and cautious, preferring to live and hunt hidden in the branches of tall trees.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder NPC Core"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":10,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":5},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":11},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":8}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":8,"special":[]},"athletics":{"base":5,"special":[]},"crafting":{"base":7,"special":[]},"nature":{"base":7,"special":[]},"stealth":{"base":11,"special":[]},"survival":{"base":7,"special":[]}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"sm"},"value":["humanoid","tripkee"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-npc-core.Actor.FYB0XBshilW7Bszx"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!gbQdLckF2ZHmyKec","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-npc-core/tripkee-camoufleur.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"pathfinder_npc_core__tripkee_camoufleur","sourcePack":"pf2e.pathfinder-npc-core","sourceDocId":"FYB0XBshilW7Bszx"}}}